    "result_text": "The full suite is just the one `AcceptanceTest` (the other two files are an abstract base and a helper). Everything is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe change adds a derived `selfLink` field to the owner representation, returning `/api/owners/` followed by the owner's id.\n\nTwo edits, following the codebase's existing pattern for computed owner fields (like `fiscalYear`, `identityKey`, `salutation`):\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `selfLink` string property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` includes the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a `@Mapping(target = \"selfLink\", ...)` on `toOwnerDto` plus a `selfLink(owner)` default method that returns `\"/api/owners/\" + owner.getId()` (null-safe when the owner or its id is absent).\n\n`mvn test` \u2192 **BUILD SUCCESS**, `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`. The acceptance test now sees `$.selfLink == \"/api/owners/\" + id` on `GET /api/owners/{id}`.",
